{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"knowledge heavy dev ops stages knowledge heavy dev ops stages","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages.md","fileName":"Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted DevOps Practice]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted DevOps Practice","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"knowledge heavy dev ops stages knowledge heavy dev ops stages","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages.md","fileName":"Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages","heading":"Knowledge-Heavy DevOps Stages","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"AI provides the most value in DevOps stages dominated by interpretation: planning, coding, testing, operations, release communication, and monitoring. It can translate requirements, scaffold code, suggest test cases, summarize failures, correlate signals, and explain changes.\n\nExecution-heavy stages have a different need. Builds, deployments, approvals, security enforcement, and secret handling depend on consistency and should remain deterministic. The placement rule is therefore not “use AI everywhere,” but use variability where it improves understanding and keep it out of paths where predictability is the control.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted DevOps Practice","agenticaiford